{"id":"vod_sn_38922","vodId":"38922","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"欢迎加入NHK","name_cn":"欢迎加入NHK","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/efb03b16c5b93bfda64f3fc87ace47cd.jpg"},"summary":"作为一个四年前从学校退学之后就一直靠啃老来过活的死宅男佐藤达广（小泉豊 配音）来说，今天也是家里蹲的一天。突然间，一阵敲门声打破了他的日常妄想。打开门，出现在门口的美少女让佐藤简直不敢相信自己的眼睛，而美少女说出的话也让佐藤吃惊的说不出话来。原来，少女名叫中原岬（牧野由 依 配音），自称是“日本废柴协会”的成员，而她此行到来的目的，正是帮助佐藤重新振作，脱离废柴的行列。　　一直住在隔壁的动漫美少女控山崎薰（坂口大助 配音）也是协会的一员？进入协会的首要任务就是制作H游戏？口口声声要帮助自己的中原自己也是一个只有靠帮助他人才能找到存在感的废柴？诸多事件的发生让佐藤渐渐开始怀疑，这个所谓的协会，很有可能是一个阴谋。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MpSuL02HDf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3LMswSnPxB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9XWCiD2HAx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Za4c1NcV4v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BPJCQnwpz31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wSvrmumeD91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gajnDjpAG11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YdDzBfWXah1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FWWX8bS6Qh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FHZwxMN98W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/25p2BBUdSz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PdRkYcuCiK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q0AF7Ak5er1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/en4kS2NV511/video/